---
title: contrai-scraper — a fleet worker (Worker.run)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Egress : the window opens<br/>after login_stagger_s × its place

    Egress : <b>egress gate</b><br/>one SharedEgressGate for the fleet<br/>refused · wait idle_poll_minutes, ask again
    Session : <b>session</b><br/>a fresh context on the shared Chromium<br/>a raw log of its own · log in
    Census : <b>census</b> · once a process<br/>observe · census_hops tables read<br/>into the registry, nothing recorded
    Hall : <b>in the lobby</b><br/>LobbyWatcher reads the socket until<br/>the tournament row raises its full flag
    Claim : <b>claim the roster</b><br/>TableRegistry, keyed by the four accounts
    Chasing : <b>chasing</b><br/>out to observe · a blind scan<br/>four accounts, or roster_mismatch and a hop<br/>gives up on distinct_budget, deadline<br/>or target_refused
    Recording : <b>recording</b><br/>every other gate · the table claimed<br/>watch to the end · one record
    Back : <b>walk back</b><br/>return_to_lobby, in the page
    Failed : <b>session_failed</b>
    Down : <b>worker_down</b><br/>for the rest of the process
    Handback : <b>exit 3</b><br/>most of the fleet is down

    Egress --> Session : egress_ok
    Egress --> Down : 6 refusals in a row
    Session --> Census : first session, census_enabled
    Session --> Hall : enter_lobby
    Census --> Back : the sweep is done
    Hall --> Claim : roster_announced
    Claim --> Hall : roster_taken · roster_stale
    Claim --> Chasing : chase_started
    Chasing --> Recording : chase_matched
    Chasing --> Back : chase_gave_up
    Recording --> Back : chase_ended
    Back --> Hall : the list is showing
    Back --> Egress : a step does not land<br/>return_rebuilt · no budget spent
    Session --> Failed : any step raises
    Failed --> Egress : after idle_poll_minutes
    Failed --> Down : 3 in a row
    Down --> Handback : down × 2 > workers
    Down --> [*]
    Hall --> [*] : window closed · limits met

    note right of Failed
        A chase that ran its course,
        whatever it found, clears the streak:
        a profile every chase breaks on
        cannot keep logging in forever.
    end note

